===Adjective===
{{ru-adj|бе́лый|беле́е|dim=бе́ленький|aug=белю́щий}}

# [[white]]
# [[white]], [[Caucasian]]
# [[light]], [[fair]]

====Usage notes====
* An unusual use of the short form occurs in the expression {{m|ru|[[средь бела дня|средь '''бе́ла''' дня́]]||[[in broad daylight]]|lit=[[amidst]] a [[white|'''white''']] [[day]]}}; here '''бе́ла''' is an old short masculine genitive.
* Another now-unused short form is found in the phrase {{m|ru|по '''бе́лу''' све́ту||about the world|lit=across the '''white''' earth}}; '''бе́лу''' is an old short masculine dative.

